            <ArticleTitle>A rare presentation of foot pain: bilateral navicular-medial cuneiform coalition.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>181-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.7547/0003-0538-105.2.181</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this case report, we discuss a rare tarsal coalition occurring bilaterally between the navicular and the medial cuneiform in a 15-year-old girl and highlight the management of such cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
